{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ee4ba305ab1983e8bca6f73f309acd2f.avif?t=1755729356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras_big/ee4ba305ab1983e8bca6f73f309acd2f.avif?t=1755729356 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a quest to free your Village from a the <i><strong>CURSE OF THE FOREST</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an\u00a0<i><strong>Evil Shaman</strong></i>\u00a0cursed <strong>Albadusk Village</strong> and its surroundings with <strong>Dark Magic, </strong>the surrounding Forest grew in a disproportional manner trapping everyone inside. <br><br>A Priest, a Soldier and <strong>you</strong>, a young Novice Priestess, are sent to investigate by the Viceroy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now your mission is to break the curse in <strong>Albadusk</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/7d5258c3ba2b90017298e67198b8d597.poster.avif?t=1755729356\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/7d5258c3ba2b90017298e67198b8d597.webm?t=1755729356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/7d5258c3ba2b90017298e67198b8d597.mp4?t=1755729356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/2211ed81ea94edf94ce98c06075c4f4e.avif?t=1755729356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras_big/2211ed81ea94edf94ce98c06075c4f4e.avif?t=1755729356 width=800 height=160 /></span><strong>Beware with Monsters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed by <strong><i>The Shaman,</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>the land is filled with all kinds of evil creatures. Being good at combat will be essential for <strong>survival</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/6719e0c53e9f0b8aac5b989af86ffe31.poster.avif?t=1755729356\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/6719e0c53e9f0b8aac5b989af86ffe31.webm?t=1755729356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/6719e0c53e9f0b8aac5b989af86ffe31.mp4?t=1755729356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into different <strong>Dungeons</strong> and <strong>Landscapes</strong>\u00a0in your search to break the <i><strong>Curse.</strong></i>\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/177df724583e449780bcf5bc970d5cd7.poster.avif?t=1755729356\" width=794 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/177df724583e449780bcf5bc970d5cd7.webm?t=1755729356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/177df724583e449780bcf5bc970d5cd7.mp4?t=1755729356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Dungeons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and Special Spells are required to solve puzzles. But are found in different regions of the game, so exploration is key! \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/2d3645d3497ae24f5136a9bf35601aad.poster.avif?t=1755729356\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/2d3645d3497ae24f5136a9bf35601aad.webm?t=1755729356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/2d3645d3497ae24f5136a9bf35601aad.mp4?t=1755729356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Albadusk Village</strong>\u00a0is a HUB where you are  able to access different areas dedicated to a different God. The Eternal, The Nocturnal and Alba the Crossbreed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/42308f9009ad2202436f40a599e5cc0f.avif?t=1755729356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras_big/42308f9009ad2202436f40a599e5cc0f.avif?t=1755729356 width=800 height=160 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong><br><br>From <i>Albadusk</i> you can access three different regions to explore. Each containing challenges, puzzles, enemies and odd characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mixture of Gimmick and Combat Bosses\u00a0</strong><br><br>Not every boss is the same. On every encounter you need to figure how to approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Dungeons\u00a0</strong><br><br>The only way forward in any dungeon is through wit, attention to detail, and reasoning.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover deep lore</strong><br>Learn the <i><strong>legend of Velcira</strong></i> the first <strong>Priestess</strong>, the <i><strong>Eternal gods</strong></i>, and the mystery of <i><strong>the Shaman</strong></i>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere\u00a0</strong><br><br>Inspired by <strong>the N64 Era</strong>, with the <strong>soul of a survival horror</strong>   <br>Dungeon design, free exploration, and a constant sense of danger and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark religious aesthetics</strong><br>Culturally inspired on\u00a0<i><strong>Mexican Culture and Catholicism</strong></i>\u00a0featuring <i><strong>Gothic and Baroque</strong></i> art-style, and a liturgical nightmare ambiance all flavored with inspirations </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776070?t=1755729356","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776070?t=1755729356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/b0b6d9918f17b8ff9b6f4c03b71bb15bf13e23d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755729356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/b0b6d9918f17b8ff9b6f4c03b71bb15bf13e23d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755729356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ee4ba305ab1983e8bca6f73f309acd2f.avif?t=1755729356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_