6070/833508a0c0bd96ecbbfceadfd24063db90a6fcca/ss_833508a0c0bd96ecbbfceadfd24063db90a6fcca.600x338.jpg?t=1755729356"}],"short_description":"Noctheria is an Action-adventure mixed with Survival Horror inspired by the N64 era. Play as The Novice in a quest to save the Kingdom of Alabadusk, explore Temples, solve Puzzles and meet odd characters in a cursed dark fantasy world.","steam_appid":3776070,"support_info":{"email":"indiegamedevboi@gmail.com","url":"zombiebyte.io"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://zombiebyte.io"}